# G0: status of the four-card set, an all-four reset with the heal, then build the tp4-vglue image (the tp4/vglue head, which
# MERGES origin/tp4/stack-fix: the four-card prefill-after-packed garbage/EOS fix, so a prefill after packed rounds in G1/G3 is not
# stopped by a defect vglue did not cause; build from a commit that contains it, never from the pre-merge head: the five
# verify-glue levers, their DMA kernels and twins in both image copy lists and the C2 overlay, the seven vglue profiles). The build
# opens no card; the reset first means a card, link or hugepage fault fails here, before the smokes. Run first.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the four-card verify-glue window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it):
# copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/vglue and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here
# names a rig, a card or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The window's jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed
# from this branch.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG names the image G0 builds from this same commit; a later commit needs a new tag.
# C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-vglue-1 is a PLACEHOLDER: set it (in every template of the window) to the tag the driver of the window picks, once
# the image is built from the pushed branch.
# Duration (estimate, wall clock): status 1-2 min; reset and heal 3-6 min (up to 12); build 7-15 min with the image's layers cached
# (the bundle stage is; only the overlay, the twins and the profiles are new), 30-70 min cold (step limit 75). Typical 18 min, at
# most 90. It runs the image copy-closure and overlay tests inside the P8 base and G1 provenance first, and tags the image only if
# they pass, so a closure error fails here with no card touched. Check df on the rig first: a new image is about 32 GB.
# Read: the status listing (four boards, one firmware bundle, at least 4 free 1 GiB hugepages, no holders, no platform serving
# container, disk); the build log (closure tests OK, provenance passed, tp4_vglue.py, gdn_rows_dma_tp.cpp, gdn_commit_lanes_tp.cpp
# and attention_block_fold_tp.cpp in the image).
# STOP on any failure.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=status reset build
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-vglue-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-speed-vglue
